description	"The Super Battle Droid - Cortosis Variant

For any Jedi or melee user, this Super Battle Droid is an absolute nightmare. It is near completely immune to force powers and melee attacks and wears armor capable of withstanding multiple lightsaber strikes. It is, however, less effective against blaster wielding classes.

^2Weaponry:
- Arm Blaster
-- Firepower (2)
-- Arm Blaster Cannon ^3[Weapon Mode]

^8Attributes:
- Melee Resistance
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Advanced Logic (2)
- Cortosis Plating (2)
- Blast Armour
- Strength (3)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Extremely effective against hand-to-hand combat types like Jedi and Wookiees.
^1Weaknesses^7: Vulnerable against Blaster Fire, and pulse grenades/rockets."